# Third-party notices

## Method reference

This repository contains an independent, pure-Jittor implementation informed
by the following paper and its official reference implementation. It is not
a copy of the reference repository.

- C. Guo, Z. Liu, and Y. He, "Guiding Point Cloud Denoising with Learned
  Structural Priors," AAAI 2026, DOI: 10.1609/aaai.v40i6.42437.
- Reference implementation: https://github.com/git-guocc/PGD

## Runtime dependencies

Jittor, NumPy, SciPy, Point Cloud Utils, PyYAML, TensorBoard, and TensorBoardX
are installed as dependencies. Their licenses and notices remain those of
their respective upstream projects; see their distributions for details.
